  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An object moves with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> along a line segment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> respectively as shown in figure. Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>, then average speed of the object will be :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1726bfef-9400-4a3f-8da9-dc573cc3932a-9896108.PNG\" style=\"width: 206px; height: 50px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "72QCv",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
