  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Speed of an object is defined as the distance travelled by the object per unit time.</p><p>Let&#39;s assume that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></math>. So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></math>. Also, assume that the time required by the object to travel&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;respectively.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the average speed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the object is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Substitute the expressions for the parameters into equation (1) and simplify to obtain the required average speed of the object.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
